vFM Player - MIDI examples

SD folder: /vFM/tests/midi

Small original MID examples exercise notes, tempo and percussion. MIDI banks must already be installed in /vFM/midi. These are examples, not required resources.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/tests/midi

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
